<view class="guide-screen"><view class="eyebrow">{{site.year}} · UNESCO {{site.unescoId}}</view><view class="heading">{{site.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{provinceLabel}} · {{site.category==='mixed'?'文化与自然双遗产':'世界文化遗产'}}</view><image class="cover" src="{{prefix}}{{site.cover}}.jpg" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview"/><button class="text-link" bindtap="credits">摄影与许可 · 复制来源 ↗</button><button class="outline" bindtap="toggleSave">{{saved?'♥ 已收藏':'♡ 收藏这处遗产'}}</button><view class="section-title">{{site.theme}}</view><view class="article">{{site.intro}}</view><view class="section-title">先认清范围，再出发</view><view class="article">{{site.componentsNote}}</view><view class="note">{{site.provinceScope}}</view><view class="section-title">先看这三个细节</view><view wx:for="{{site.highlights}}" wx:key="title"><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="article">{{item.text}}</view><button class="source-link" data-url="{{item.source.url}}" bindtap="copySource">资料出处 · 复制链接 ↗</button></view><view class="section-title">留一点时间，继续读</view><view class="note">原生工程提供文字阅读；浏览器小程序预览另有三套简介语音。</view><view wx:for="{{site.chapters}}" wx:key="title"><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="article">{{item.text}}</view></view><view class="section-title">出发前的一点准备</view><view class="article" wx:for="{{site.tips}}" wx:key="*this">· {{item}}</view><button class="source-link" wx:for="{{site.sources}}" wx:key="url" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="copySource">{{item.title}} · 复制链接 ↗</button><view class="note-box"><view class="section-title">留一句自己的发现</view><textarea value="{{note}}" bindinput="noteInput" maxlength="800"/><button class="solid" bindtap="saveNote">保存手记 →</button></view><view class="note">遗产参考点不是游客入口。开放、预约及交通以管理机构信息为准。</view></view>
